    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32320" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκλε-αίνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>smooth out</i> or <i>away,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥυτίδας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					191a
				</span></i>
			 : hence, <i>abolish, cause to disappear,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prorrh.</u>
				2.20
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.567f
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>smooth</i> or <i>polish off,</i> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθον</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Agatharch.
				82
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὰ φαντάσματα</span>
			<i>smooth</i> them <i>down,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.83c
			</span></i>.</div>
